{{!-- Thẻ một nội dung (Idea bank và Lưu trữ). Dùng trong vòng lặp: {{> plan/card}} (restore=true: nút "Mở lại" về Đã chọn) --}}
<li class="plan-card" data-plan-row>
  <div class="flex items-start gap-1">
    {{> plan/detail-link class="plan-card-title min-w-0 flex-1 hover:underline"}}
    {{#if canEdit}}{{> plan/edit-button}}{{/if}}
  </div>
  <p class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap gap-1 text-[11px]">
    {{#if brandInfo}}<span class="{{brandInfo.badge}}">{{brandInfo.label}}</span>{{else}}<span class="badge-gray opacity-70">Chưa chọn brand</span>{{/if}}
  </p>
  <p class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-0.5 text-xs text-ink-soft">
    {{#if shoot_date}}<span>Quay {{formatDay shoot_date}}</span>{{/if}}
    {{#if post_date}}<span>Đăng {{formatDay post_date}}</span>{{else if (eq status 'selected')}}<span class="italic text-ink-faint">Chưa có ngày đăng</span>{{/if}}
    {{#if owner_name}}<span>{{owner_name}}</span>{{/if}}
    {{#if writer_name}}<span>Kịch bản: {{writer_name}}</span>{{/if}}
    {{#if (and (not owner_name) (not writer_name) proposer_name)}}<span>{{proposer_name}}</span>{{/if}}
    {{#if reference_url}}{{#if (isUrl reference_url)}}<a href="{{reference_url}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-normal">{{> plan/link-icon}}Tham khảo</a>{{/if}}{{/if}}
    {{#each extraReferences}}{{#if (isUrl this)}}<a href="{{this}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-normal">{{> plan/link-icon}}Tham khảo {{inc (inc @index)}}</a>{{/if}}{{/each}}
    {{#if script}}{{#if (isUrl script)}}<a href="{{script}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-normal">{{> plan/link-icon}}Kịch bản</a>{{/if}}{{/if}}
    {{#if post_url}}<a href="{{post_url}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-normal">{{> plan/link-icon}}Bài đăng</a>{{/if}}
  </p>
  {{#if canEdit}}
    {{#if restore}}
      <div class="mt-2 border-t border-line pt-2">
        {{> plan/status-button id=id status="selected" label="Mở lại" full=true}}
      </div>
    {{else if nextStep}}
      <div class="mt-2 border-t border-line pt-2">
        {{#if nextStep.edit}}
          <a href="/plan/{{id}}/edit?back={{urlEncode @root.back}}" class="btn-ghost btn-sm w-full justify-center">{{nextStep.label}}</a>
        {{else}}
          {{> plan/status-button id=id status=nextStep.status label=nextStep.label full=true}}
        {{/if}}
      </div>
    {{/if}}
  {{/if}}
</li>
